␀␀␀␀␀yWN∑˙q‘␀␀‘␀␀␀␀␀content/p3p/pageInfoOverlay.js/* -*- Mode: C; tab-width: 2; indent-tabs-mode: nil; c-basic-offset: 2 -*- */
/* ***** BEGIN LICENSE BLOCK *****
 * Version: MPL 1.1/GPL 2.0/LGPL 2.1
